### Terraform ###
# Local .terraform directories
**/.terraform/*

# .tfstate files
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Plan output of `terraform plan -out=...`
*.tfplan
tfplan

# Crash log files
crash.log
crash.*.log

# tfvars files contain secrets such as the Proxmox API token.
# Copy terraform/terraform.tfvars.example to terraform/terraform.tfvars instead.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Override files are used to override resources locally
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# CLI configuration files
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Note: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally committed to pin provider versions

### Ansible ###
# Local inventory with real IPs. Copy ansible/inventory/hosts.example to ansible/inventory/hosts instead.
ansible/inventory/hosts
*.retry
.vault_pass*
vault_pass*

### Secrets and keys ###
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

### VM images downloaded by prepare-vm-template.sh ###
*.img
*.qcow2

### OS ###
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

### Editors ###
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
